                             **Pin Mapping:** I have the pin mapping for the specific components.\n\n2.  **Strategy (BFS-DC):**\n    *   **Pass 1: Anchors.** Create             
                             the board, define global nets (PWR, GND, VCC, etc.), and instantiate the main IC (U1: BQ79616PAPR).\n    *   **Pass 2: Power &                      
                             Decoupling.** Add the power supply components (Q1, LDOIN circuit) and decoupling capacitors for U1.\n    *   **Pass 3: Communication.**             
