rocess for better transparency and does not execute any code or make changes.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'description': 'Action for logging a thought without making any changes.', 'properties': {'thought': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'The thought to log.'}}, 'required': ['thought']}}]}], 'generationConfig': {'temperature': 0.0, 'top_p': 1.0, 'max_output_tokens': 65535, 'thinkingConfig': {'thinkingLevel': 'low'}}}'
