s\n*   U1\n*   U1 Decoupling (C6, C9, C7, C8, C3, C59, C2)\n*   U1 BAT Filter (R5, C5)\n\n**Decoupling details from SCUD:**\n*   AVDD (Pin 38): C6 (1uF)\n*   CVDD (Pin 45): C9 (1uF)\n*   DVDD (Pin 49): C7 (4.7uF), C8 (1uF) -> SCUD says "C7 (4.7uF), C8 (1uF)". Usually one per pin or shared. I\'ll put both on DVDD net near pin 49.\n*   LDOIN (Pin 47): C59 (0.1uF)\n*   NEG5V (Pin 44): C3 (0.1uF)\n*   TSREF (Pin 51): C2 (1uF)\n*   REFHP (Pin 37): Not explicitly listed in "Internal Regulators" list but usually needs a cap. SCUD says "TP7 (REFHP)". I\'ll check if there\'s a cap. SCUD doesn\'t list one for REFHP in the "Internal Regulators" bullet. I\'ll leave it off unless I see it in the image or later.\n    *   Wait, looking at "Internal Regulators" list again: "AVDD/CVDD/DVDD: Decoupled by C6, C9, C7, C8".\n    *   "LDOIN: C59".\n    *   "NEG5V: C3".\n    *   "TSREF: C2".\n    *   "Isolator Power: C57, C58".\n    *   Nothing for REFHP.\n\n**BAT Filter:**\n*   `PWR` net -> R5 (30R) -> `U1_BAT` net -> U1 Pin 1.\n*   `U1_BAT` net -> C5 (10nF) -> `GND`.\n\nLet\'s write this.'}, {'function_call': {'name': 'terminal', 'args': {'security_risk': 'LOW', 'command': 'find /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary -name "*.tsx"'}}, 'thoughtSignature': 'c2tpcF90aG91Z2h0X3NpZ25hdHVyZV92YWxpZGF0b3I='}]}, {'parts': [{'function_response': {'name': 'terminal', 'response': {'content': '\x1b[?2004l/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/logs/ana_w1_experiment_2_sample_2/bq79616_eval_board/circuit.tsx\n/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/logs/ana_w1_experiment_2/bq79616_eval_board/circuit.tsx\n/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/logs/ana_w1_experiment_1/bq79616_eval.tsx\n/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/logs/ana_w1_experiment_5_sample_2/bq79616_eval_board.tsx\n/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/logs/ana_experiment_3_sample_2/bq79616_eval_board.tsx\n/home