n3 = Collector\nI will assume this unless I see evidence otherwise.\n\n**Let\'s look at `subckt_bq79616_ic.png` to see if I can spot the pin names or numbers for U1 to confirm the mapping.**\nAlso `subckt_pow_supply.png` for Q1.\n\nI\'ll start by viewing the images to be safe.'}], 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_b3204920e49b4733aa8a6a3841c3', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/schematic_images/subckt_bq79616_ic.png", "command": "view", "security_risk": "LOW"}'}}, {'id': 'call_145184638aee43ec9aa089c8d45d', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"security_risk": "LOW", "command": "view", "path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/schematic_images/subckt_pow_supply.png"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Image file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/schematic_images/subckt_bq79616_ic.png read successfully. Displaying image content.'}, {'type': 'image_url', 'image_url': {'url': 'data:image/png;base64,'}}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_b3204920e49b4733aa8a6a3841c3', 'name': 'file_editor'}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Image file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/schematic_images/subckt_pow_supply.png read successfully. Displaying image content.'}, {'type': 'image_url', 'image_url': {'url': 'data:image/png;base64,'}}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_145184638aee43ec9aa089c8d45d', 'name': 'file_editor'}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'thought:The images are displayed. I can\'t "see" them directly as text, but I can assume the standard pinouts if I don\'t see explicit contradictions in the text descriptions I\'ve already read. The SCUD is very detailed.\n\n**Pin Mapping Conflict Resolution:**\n*   **U1 Pin 48:** SCUD says `NPNB`. Mapping says `BBP