                             possible, or assume standard. SCUD says \"Q1(E) -> LDOIN\", \"Q1(C) -> PWR...\", \"Q1(B) -> NPNB\".\n    *   I need to check                        
                             `ISO7342FCQDWRQ1`.\n\nLet's start by creating the file with the main IC and basic structure.\n\n**Wait, I need to verify the pinout of              
                             MMBT3904LT1G.**\nStandard SOT-23:\n1 = Base\n2 = Emitter\n3 = Collector\nI will assume this unless I see evidence otherwise.\n\n**Let's             
